/ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}comb5\\text{-}clique} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcComb5Clique}_S(A,\\langle V,E\\rangle)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{SimpleGraph}_S(\\langle V,E\\rangle)\\land A\\subseteq V\\land[A]^2\\subseteq E\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}comb5\\text{-}clique} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcComb5Clique}_S(A,\\langle V,E\\rangle)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{SimpleGraph}_S(\\langle V,E\\rangle)\\land A\\subseteq V\\land[A]^2\\subseteq E\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Every two distinct vertices of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> are adjacent, and the ambient pair <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle V,E\\rangle\">\\(\\langle V,E\\rangle\\)</span> is required to be a simple graph.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch03/58-df-graph.md","status":"resolved","id":"0dc79ccc1050ee64","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch03/58-df-graph.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch03/58-df-graph.md","status":"resolved","id":"0dc79ccc1050ee64","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{SimpleGraph}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[../batch03/58-df-graph.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"V,E,A,G\\in V,\\ G=\\langle V,E\\rangle,\\ A\\subseteq V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcComb5Clique}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SimpleGraph}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}comb5\\text{-}clique} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcComb5Clique}_S(A,\\langle V,E\\rangle)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{SimpleGraph}_S(\\langle V,E\\rangle)\\land A\\subseteq V\\land[A]^2\\subseteq E","display":true},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"\\langle V,E\\rangle","display":false}],"bytes":899,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1652","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch01/58-df-zfc-comb5-clique.md|58-df-zfc-comb5-clique]]（batch01）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","0dc79ccc1050ee64"]}